{
  "_comment": "v10-regime 2025 test: eval_frac=0.15, pos_frac=0.4. Isolates the root-cause config setting identified on WN dep (eval_frac was flipped from 0.15 in v10 to 0.85 in v11, causing ~-0.02 AUC). See exploration/reports/2026-04-20-v10-v11-shared-eval-auc.md",
  "_workflow": {
    "step_0": "python src/fetch_prune/collect_strike_cache.py",
